<section class="page" id="submit"><div class="wrap two"><div class="panel"><div class="eyebrow">Have an idea?</div><h2>Put it on the board.</h2><p style="color:var(--muted)">Make the request specific enough that other customers can recognize the problem and vote for it.</p><form action="submit.php" method="post"><input type="hidden" name="csrf" value="<?=csrf()?>"><div class="field"><label>Feature title</label><input class="input" name="title" maxlength="180" required placeholder="e.g. Add bulk export for reports"></div><div class="field"><label>What would you like to see?</label><textarea name="description" rows="6" required placeholder="Describe the problem, your ideal solution, and who would benefit."></textarea></div><div class="field"><label>Category</label><select class="select" name="category"><option>Product</option><option>Integrations</option><option>Mobile</option><option>Experience</option><option>Admin</option><option>Billing</option></select></div><div class="field"><label>Your name</label><input class="input" name="name" maxlength="120" required></div><div class="field"><label>Email</label><input class="input" type="email" name="email" maxlength="190" required></div><button class="btn orange">Publish request</button></form></div><div><div class="panel"><h2>How it works</h2><p><b>01 · Submit</b><br><span style="color:var(--muted)">Describe the customer problem.</span></p><p><b>02 · Vote</b><br><span style="color:var(--muted)">Upvote requests you want most.</span></p><p><b>03 · Track</b><br><span style="color:var(--muted)">Watch the team move ideas through the roadmap.</span></p></div></div></div></section><?php require 'footer.php';?>
